Cell["\<\
The MagneticTB 1.0 functions are included under MagneticTBOld`, with old \
appended to their names. They can run earlier notebooks and provide a direct \
comparison with version 2.0. Load the 1.0 and 2.0 versions in separate \
kernels.\
